e’s structure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(type\/attrs) and its position anchors, because in a tree id-order is not"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sibling-order: left_sibling_id and right_sibling_id are redundant external","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"boundary anchors of the deleted run, so restore can reconstruct the run’s","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"internal order from the op’s own spans and needs only one surviving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"boundary to place it. value\/attributes are a deep copy so a GC-purged node"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can be recreated."}],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/yorkie_v1_treerestorespan"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan/array(fromJSONString:extensions:options:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan\/array(fromJSONString:extensions:options:)","title":"array(fromJSONString:extensions:options:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/yorkie_v1_treerestorespan\/array(fromjsonstring:extensions:options:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"array","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"fromJSONString","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"extensions","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ExtensionMap","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiftProtobuf12ExtensionMapP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"options","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"JSONDecodingOptions","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiftProtobuf19JSONDecodingOptionsV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"